      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Faculty of Information Technologies is a department within NSU that provides education in computer science and engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;FIT is a faculty that prepares bachelors in informatics and computer engineering, combining fundamental training with practical experience.&lt;SEP&gt;The faculty offering a bachelor's degree program and various student support services.</data>
